  lectureName: SaveSystem
  lectureTitle: Save System
  exerciseListSO: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 22bd4f4e118e78f4585a22e211b8a692, type: 2}
  lectureDescription: 'Save System can store any data you want, in this case storing
    resource amounts and objects in the world.


    In this Scenario the player
    can walk around and gather resources. Then they can save the state of the game,
    and with another key load the previously saved game state which will load the
    amounts and any objects placed in the world.'
